{"page":298,"verses":[{"verse_key":"18:35","surah":18,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"وَدَخَلَ جَنَّتَهُۥ وَهُوَ ظَالِمٌ لِّنَفْسِهِۦ قَالَ مَآ أَظُنُّ أَن تَبِيدَ هَـٰذِهِۦٓ أَبَدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He went into his garden and wronged himself by saying, ‘I do not think this will ever perish,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَدَخَلَ","en_gloss":"And he entered","transliteration":"wadakhala","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَنَّتَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his garden","transliteration":"jannatahu","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"while he","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ظَالِمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(was) unjust","transliteration":"ẓālimun","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّنَفْسِهِۦ","en_gloss":"to himself","transliteration":"linafsihi","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَظُنُّ","en_gloss":"I think","transliteration":"aẓunnu","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَبِيدَ","en_gloss":"will perish","transliteration":"tabīda","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَبَدًۭا","en_gloss":"ever","transliteration":"abadan","verse_key":"18:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:35"}]},{"verse_key":"18:36","surah":18,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَظُنُّ ٱلسَّاعَةَ قَآئِمَةً وَلَئِن رُّدِدتُّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّى لَأَجِدَنَّ خَيْرًا مِّنْهَا مُنقَلَبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"or that the Last Hour will ever come- even if I were to be taken back to my Lord, I would certainly find something even better there.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"18:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَظُنُّ","en_gloss":"I think"